    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apocalypse Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Explore. Fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of an ex-scientist thrust into a harrowing mission on a desolate land overrun by the undead. This First-Person Survival Open World adventure challenges you to fight for your life against relentless zombies while uncovering the island's dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274800/extras/9cb2ab87107f11af2adaa6ede1e2dfc2.poster.avif?t=1749387643\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274800/extras/9cb2ab87107f11af2adaa6ede1e2dfc2.webm?t=1749387643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274800/extras/9cb2ab87107f11af2adaa6ede1e2dfc2.mp4?t=1749387643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Open World Exploration:</strong> Traverse lush forests, abandoned cities, and mysterious locations filled with hidden dangers and valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f <strong>Survival Mechanics:</strong> Manage your hunger, thirst, fatigue, and health. Scavenge for food, drinks, and supplies to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274800/extras/839fa260b60ca05ec92e32a98d4c521a.poster.avif?t=1749387643\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274800/extras/839fa260b60ca05ec92e32a98d4c521a.webm?t=1749387643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274800/extras/839fa260b60ca05ec92e32a98d4c521a.mp4?t=1749387643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Resource Gathering &amp; Crafting:</strong> Loot the environment to find materials, craft essential items, and build shelters to protect yourself from both the undead and the harsh elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274800/extras/f6e80955905b43240d4fcdb82c251956.poster.avif?t=1749387643\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274800/extras/f6e80955905b43240d4fcdb82c251956.webm?t=1749387643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274800/extras/f6e80955905b43240d4fcdb82c251956.mp4?t=1749387643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Diverse Arsenal:</strong> Start with your trusty Hunting Hatchet and discover powerful weapons like axes, swords, and firearms as you explore deeper into the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Realistic Needs System:</strong> Experience the struggle of true survival\u2014hunt wildlife, cook raw meat, gather vegetables, and secure fresh water to sustain yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face the horrors lurking on <i>Apocalypse Island</i>? Your survival depends on it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apocalypse Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Explore. Fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of an ex-scientist thrust into a harrowing mission on a desolate land overrun by the undead. This First-Person Survival Open World adventure challenges you to fight for your life against relentless zombies while uncovering the island's dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274800/extras/9cb2ab87107f11af2adaa6ede1e2dfc2.poster.avif?t=1749387643\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274800/extras/9cb2ab87107f11af2adaa6ede1e2dfc2.webm?t=1749387643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274800/extras/9cb2ab87107f11af2adaa6ede1e2dfc2.mp4?t=1749387643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Open World Exploration:</strong> Traverse lush forests, abandoned cities, and mysterious locations filled with hidden dangers and valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f <strong>Survival Mechanics:</strong> Manage your hunger, thirst, fatigue, and health. Scavenge for food, drinks, and supplies to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274800/extras/839fa260b60ca05ec92e32a98d4c521a.poster.avif?t=1749387643\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274800/extras/839fa260b60ca05ec92e32a98d4c521a.webm?t=1749387643\" type=\